%% PathMate.ai - Cover Letter Generation sequence
%% Render: https://mermaid.live

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant API as cover-letter API
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant OAI as OpenAI API

    User->>FE: Open /cover-letter page
    FE->>Auth: getSessionWithRetry()
    Auth-->>FE: JWT access_token

    FE->>API: GET /api/cover-letter with Bearer
    API->>Auth: getUserFromToken()
    API->>DB: cover_letters select limit 20
    DB-->>API: History rows
    API-->>FE: items array
    FE-->>User: Show past letters

    User->>FE: Submit resumeText jobDescription tone
    FE->>FE: generateCoverLetter handler

    FE->>API: POST /api/cover-letter JSON body
    API->>Auth: getUserFromToken()
    API->>DB: profiles.select for context

    API->>API: Build profileContext and tone prompt

    API->>OAI: responses.create gpt-4o-mini
    OAI-->>API: generated_text draft

    API->>DB: cover_letters.insert

    alt Insert succeeded
        API-->>FE: id createdAt generatedText
        FE->>FE: Update UI and reload history
        FE-->>User: Display new cover letter
    else Insert failed
        API-->>FE: 500 error
        FE-->>User: Show error message
    end
